# Normalize line endings to LF across the repo.
# Windows local checkouts (core.autocrlf=true) used to produce CRLF working
# trees, which broke binstubs (`bin/*`) when COPY'd into Linux containers.
# Force LF everywhere; binary assets are explicitly marked.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png text eol=lf binary
*.jpg text eol=lf binary
*.jpeg text eol=lf binary
*.gif text eol=lf binary
*.ico text eol=lf binary
*.pdf text eol=lf binary
*.woff text eol=lf binary
*.woff2 text eol=lf binary
*.otf text eol=lf binary
*.ttf text eol=lf binary
*.eot text eol=lf binary
*.avif text eol=lf binary
*.webp text eol=lf binary
